</p></sec><sec id="sec2.4"><label>2.4</label><title>Sedimentation (%)</title><p>The prepared milk-based
cocoa beverages taken into glass bottles closed with a plastic cap
were stored at 4 ± 1 °C for 21 days. The sedimentation value
(%) was expressed as the ratio of the height of the sediment at the
bottom to the height of the milk-based cocoa beverages.<xref rid="ref11" ref-type="bibr"/>
